# Agent instruction files stay local to a working copy and out of this public
# repo. They are internal engineering guidance, and hatchling's sdist picks up
# top-level files, so a tracked copy also ends up inside the published tarball
# on PyPI (it did, in 0.3.0 / 0.4.0 / 0.5.0). Keep your own copy untracked.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
